# The places that cite an ADR number this record has superseded, read by tests/adr_citations.rs.
# One entry per line, a path and an identifier separated by a tab: the file may cite that ADR. The
# entries are grouped by why the number stands. An entry that names no citation fails the test,
# and so does one whose ADR is in force again: a normalization that restates ADR-0002 and ADR-0005
# at the template's numbers drops their entries (docs/CONVENTIONS.md).

